PASS D1d minimum over the 216 tests on the Q3 sample is 0 >= 0
PASS D2a classical: native image of a diagonal state stays diagonal and nonnegative (upper route excludes nothing classical)
PASS D2b classical: lower route output Phi+ is not diagonal (classical cone excluded by H1_3+NC_3+RO_3+DIS; it already fails H1)
PASS D3a control: identity in place of C (spectator token 3) gives minimum 0 >= 0 over the 216 tests
